# Per-account pool state. The un-suffixed forms were already ignored, but the
# _2.._5 variants were committed before those rules existed, so gitignore alone
# never untracked them — gitignore is only consulted for files git isn't already
# tracking. They were removed from the index with `git rm --cached` in a7ea561
# (2026-07-31); the files themselves stay on disk, since the running pool needs
# them. Note engine_stats.jsonl (data) is ignored while engine_stats.py (code)
# stays tracked.
copilot_session_*.json
copilot_cooldown*.json
engine_stats.jsonl
engine_stats_archived.jsonl
run.log*
supervisor.log*
supervisor_state.json.conflict*
_chatgpt_imagegen_tmp/
_auto2_temp/
service_*_stdout.log*
service_*_stderr.log*
app_server*.log
scratch_*
*.bak
debug_*.json
gemini_cooldown*.json

